    {
      "id": "mcousli",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Gram Sabha"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mwe7zb0",
      "content": "• Consists of all registered voters in the village."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ftsfxrx",
      "content": "• Acts as the foundation of the Panchayati Raj system."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5uv5mhu",
      "content": "• Approves plans and budgets of the Gram Panchayat."
    },
    {
      "id": "hhkd2zv",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. Gram Panchayat"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6wpbtdc",
      "content": "• Executive body at village level."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pdd3vuq",
      "content": "• Members elected directly by villagers."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gkkjeu1",
      "content": "• The head is called Sarpanch or Pradhan."
    },
    {
      "id": "fh8z31c",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Panchayat Samiti"
    },
    {
      "type": "comparisonTable",
      "headers": [
        "Tier Level",
        "Panchayati Body",
        "Administrative Level"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Primary Tier",
          "Gram Panchayat",
          "Village Level"
        ],
        [
          "Intermediate Tier",
          "Panchayat Samiti",
          "Block/Taluka Level"
        ],
        [
          "Apex Tier",
          "Zila Parishad",
          "District Level"
        ]
      ],
      "id": "ji5z5i3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "e2cg8my",
      "content": "• Works at block level."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mfkbcu3",
      "content": "• Coordinates activities of Gram Panchayats."
    },
    {
      "id": "t8hsaul",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Zila Parishad"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ly3yop5",
      "content": "• Functions at district level."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zyas8yu",
      "content": "• Supervises Panchayat Samitis."
    },
    {
      "id": "ejqecy0",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Key Features of the System"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "d8nrwiy",
      "content": "• Three-tier structure of governance."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cx8mxj8",
      "content": "• Regular elections every five years."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wo0olta",
      "content": "• Reservation for SC, ST and women."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "v5kyj8u",
      "content": "• State Election Commission for conducting elections."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Part IX of the Constitution contains the key constitutional provisions regarding Panchayati Raj.",
        "Understand the correct hierarchy of the Three-Tier Structure: Gram Panchayat at village level, Panchayat Samiti at block level, and Zila Parishad at district level.",
        "Gram Sabha is the primary village-level body established under local governance provisions."
      ],
      "id": "oq8urhy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4f55uvo",
      "content": "• State Finance Commission for financial review."
    },
    {
      "id": "skjf940",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "EXAM Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "e7z7b7a",
      "content": "• 73rd Constitutional Amendment Act (1992) introduced Panchayati Raj."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "22ke4dd",
      "content": "• Gram Sabha is the basic unit of rural democracy."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "l4h8etb",
      "content": "• At least one-third seats reserved for women."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "p5ce77w",
      "content": "• Panchayat elections are held every 5 years."
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
